# =============================================
# SETUP INSTRUCTIONS:
# =============================================
# 
# 1. CREATE FIREBASE PROJECT:
#    → Go to https://console.firebase.google.com
#    → Click "Create a project"  
#    → Project name: "rccg-lsc-abuja"
#    → Enable Google Analytics (recommended)
# 
# 2. ENABLE SERVICES:
#    → Authentication: Enable Email/Password and Google
#    → Firestore: Create database in test mode
#    → Storage: Create storage bucket
#    → Functions: Will be enabled when you deploy
# 
# 3. GET WEB APP CONFIG:
#    → Project Settings → Your apps → Add app → Web
#    → App name: "RCCG LSC Abuja Web"
#    → Copy the config object values to the NEXT_PUBLIC_ variables above
# 
# 4. GET SERVICE ACCOUNT:
#    → Project Settings → Service accounts → Generate new private key
#    → Download JSON file and extract values for FIREBASE_ variables above
# 
# 5. TEST SETUP:
#    → npm run verify:setup (check files)
#    → npm run test:firebase (test connection)
#    → npm run dev (start development server)
# 
# =============================================

# Optional: Email Configuration (for notifications)
# SENDGRID_API_KEY=your_sendgrid_api_key
# RESEND_API_KEY=your_resend_api_key

# Optional: Payment Configuration (for donations)
# PAYSTACK_PUBLIC_KEY=pk_test_your_paystack_public_key
# PAYSTACK_SECRET_KEY=sk_test_your_paystack_secret_key
# STRIPE_PUBLIC_KEY=pk_test_your_stripe_public_key  
# STRIPE_SECRET_KEY=sk_test_your_stripe_secret_key